<p>Hello <%= @user.username.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your password for your account on <strong><%= @site_name %></strong>.</p>

<p>Click the button below to set a new password. This link will expire in two hours.</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:20px 0;">
  <a href="<%= @reset_url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#347ec9;color:#fff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Reset password</a>
</p>

<p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>